---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Ralphi IA / Ralph AI" description="The coordination and automation layer behind the InnerChispa ecosystem.">
  <section class="hero">
    <span class="eyebrow">Ralphi IA / Ralph AI</span>
    <h1 data-es="El cerebro operativo del ecosistema." data-en="The ecosystem’s operational brain.">The ecosystem’s operational brain.</h1>
    <p data-es="MCP, memoria compartida, herramientas publicadas, WhatsApp, correo, fondos, reportes y agentes. Una capa común para que ChatGPT, Cursor, Codex y Antigravity trabajen sin perder contexto." data-en="MCP, shared memory, published tools, WhatsApp, email, funding, reports, and agents. One common layer so ChatGPT, Cursor, Codex, and Antigravity can work without losing context.">MCP, shared memory, published tools, WhatsApp, email, funding, reports, and agents. One common layer so ChatGPT, Cursor, Codex, and Antigravity can work without losing context.</p>
  </section>
  <div class="grid cols-2">
    <section class="section stack">
      <h2 data-es="Flujos operativos" data-en="Operational flows">Operational flows</h2>
      <div class="card" data-es="ChatGPT → MCP → MongoDB → buzones → evidencia" data-en="ChatGPT → MCP → MongoDB → inboxes → evidence">ChatGPT → MCP → MongoDB → inboxes → evidence</div>
      <div class="card" data-es="WhatsApp → comandos, grupos, recordatorios, documentos y estados" data-en="WhatsApp → commands, groups, reminders, documents, and status">WhatsApp → commands, groups, reminders, documents, and status</div>
      <div class="card" data-es="Fondos → programas, solicitudes, cuentas y consumo trazable" data-en="Funding → programs, applications, accounts, and traceable usage">Funding → programs, applications, accounts, and traceable usage</div>
    </section>
    <section class="section stack">
      <h2 data-es="Conectores vivos" data-en="Live connectors">Live connectors</h2>
      <div class="card" data-es="OAuth + claves API para una compatibilidad controlada" data-en="OAuth + API keys for controlled compatibility">OAuth + API keys for controlled compatibility</div>
      <div class="card" data-es="MongoDB como fuente de verdad y Markdown como espejo humano" data-en="MongoDB as the source of truth and Markdown as a human-readable mirror">MongoDB as the source of truth and Markdown as a human-readable mirror</div>
      <div class="card" data-es="Procesamiento local primero para privacidad, velocidad y ahorro" data-en="Local-first processing for privacy, speed, and efficiency">Local-first processing for privacy, speed, and efficiency</div>
    </section>
  </div>
</Base>
